24. Tenant’s liability or legal responsibility

We will pay costs that you or your family become legally liable to pay as a tenant. We must
agree any costs in writing. We will pay costs for:
■ damage to the buildings by causes 1-12 listed in the contents section of this policy.
■ accidental damage to cables, drain inspection covers or underground drains, pipes or
tanks giving services to or from the home.
■ accidental breakage of fixed glass in:
■ windows;
■ doors;
■ fanlights;
■ skylights;
■ greenhouses;
■ conservatories;
■ verandas.
■ accidental breakage of fixed ceramic hobs or hob covers.
■ accidental breakage of fixed sinks, baths, wash basins,

